    "quote": "If a float sample is matched with a histogram sample, the behavior follows the",
    "statement": "If a float sample is matched with a histogram sample, the behavior follows the same logic as between a scalar and a histogram sample (see above), i.e.",
    "url": "https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/blob/0e62286556b1cb798d0afdde11f11689b6cfcd7a/docs/querying/operators.md#L91-L91"
